   "text": "Thick arrows mark the main contribution to a file; thin arrows a single fact or convention. The syntax file and the table come from binwalk's own option table, not from the manual\nor from runs; the two classes come from the runs. Not consulted: the web, PaSh's code, any documentation beyond the manual and --help.",
